        "created_at": "2013-08-29T02:19:53.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>\"Crazy people are listing it for $2k\" is not the same as \"It's selling for $2k.\"</p><p>Browsing closed listings, it looks like it's actually SELLING for more like $20, and if it's priced much higher than that, no one bites. So I don't think anyone has to worry about someone paying $2k.</p><p>If it comes to it, though, I'm going to undercut you all and sell mine for a mere $1k. Plus $500 shipping.</p>",
